38ced2aa-fdb9-4663-9183-3a6992a12244	Template updated	UPDATED	1763749220357	9a8b7c6d-5e4f-3210-9876-543210fedcba	kyadmin	<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang="en" style="margin:0;padding:0;">\n<head>\n  <meta charset="UTF-8" />\n  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />\n  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />\n  <title>Role Revocation Notification - AIdentX</title>\n</head>\n<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f7fb;">\n  <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background:#f4f7fb;">\n    <tr>\n      <td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">\n        \n        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="600" \n               style="width:600px;max-width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e6eef5;">\n          \n          <!-- Header -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style="padding:24px;border-top-left-radius:12px;border-top-right-radius:12px;background:#448BC5;">\n              <div style="font-family:Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\n                          font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;">\n                AIdentX\n              </div>\n              <div style="height:4px;"></div>\n              <div style="font-family:Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\n                          font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#eaf3fc;">\n                Unified. Intelligent. Automated.\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Body -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style="padding:28px 24px;font-family:Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;color:#12232e;">\n              \n              <h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#12232e;">\n                Role Revocation Notification\n              </h1>\n\n              <p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;">\n                Dear <strong>${username}</strong>,\n              </p>\n\n              <p style="margin:0 0 20px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;">\n                We would like to inform you that your access to the \n                <strong>${roleName}</strong> role has been revoked.\n              </p>\n\n              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:12px 0 20px 0;">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style="background:#fdf4f4;border:1px solid #f3d1d1;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;">\n                    <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#772e2e;">\n                      If you believe this change was made in error, please contact your administrator or the IAM team immediately.\n                    </p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n\n              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px 0;">\n                <tr>\n                  <td>\n                    <a href="https://your-aidentx-portal.example/roles"\n                       style="display:inline-block;background:#448BC5;border:1px solid #397ab0;\n                              border-radius:8px;padding:12px 18px;color:white;text-decoration:none;\n                              font-family:Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;">\n                      View My Roles\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n\n              <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e6eef5;margin:20px 0;" />\n\n              <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#5b6b7c;">\n                For assistance, contact the IAM Support Team at \n                <a href="mailto:iam-support@aidentx.com" style="color:#448BC5;text-decoration:none;">\n                  iam-support@aidentx.com\n                </a>.\n              </p>\n\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style="padding:18px 24px;">\n              <p style="margin:0;font-size:11px;color:#7a8a9a;font-family:Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;">\n                © ${year} AIdentX. All rights reserved.<br/>\n                This is an automated message — please do not reply.\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>\n	t	t	EN_UK	ec6dfe6c-edc4-4c2c-8a36-250d918f3ec7	Revoke role	Revocation of Role ${roleName} from ${username}	tenant_001	REVOKE_INTERNAL_ROLE	4
